          <p class="rg-note">Times are when the zone is closed to cars without a pass. Public holidays have no daytime restriction. The summer timetable is re-set by ordinance each year; the 2026 one was confirmed by the Polizia Municipale on 24 May and runs to 31 October. The streets forming the perimeter are always open. Mondello’s summer evening zone is separate — see below.</p>
